      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "No database exporter is installed for this local baseline. Inspect MySQL slow-query evidence with:\n\n```sh\ndocker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.observability.yaml exec mysql sh -c 'mysql -uroot -p\"$MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD\" -e \"SHOW VARIABLES; SHOW GLOBAL STATUS;\"' | grep -E 'slow_query_log|long_query_time|Slow_queries'\n```\n\nUse Hikari panels above to correlate pool pressure before adding tooling."
